      "commit": {
        "date": "2026-05-14T18:09:15Z",
        "message": "Update README example and writeup script defaults to current models\n\nBring README's example .llm_config.yaml in line with the active\nconfig (claude-opus-4-7 + gpt-5.5). Update the --model default in\nthe README arg list. Replace bedrock claude-3-5-sonnet defaults in\nperform_writeup.py / perform_icbinb_writeup.py citation argparse\ndefaults with bedrock/anthropic.claude-sonnet-4-6 so they match the\nupdated AVAILABLE_LLMS choices.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "7712d54620e9e45c68e64afdedc6ffc9ccd315a3",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ltjed/freephdlabor/git/trees/7712d54620e9e45c68e64afdedc6ffc9ccd315a3"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sha": "e39a4e437ad3843092e84f18bafd32d662231cdc",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/ltjed/freephdlabor/commit/e39a4e437ad3843092e84f18bafd32d662231cdc",
      "commit": {
        "date": "2026-05-14T18:06:42Z",
        "message": "Drop DeepSeek model support\n\nRemove DeepSeek model IDs (deepseek-chat, deepseek-coder,\ndeepseek-reasoner, deepseek-coder-v2-0724, deepseek/deepseek-r1:nitro)\nfrom AVAILABLE_MODELS / AVAILABLE_LLMS / MODEL_CONTEXT_LIMITS, and\nremove the corresponding code branches from utils.py::create_model\nand llm.py::{create_client, get_response_from_llm,\nget_batch_responses_from_llm}.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "83e79140b3a78c4c6d18560c1881d7379b299235",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ltjed/freephdlabor/git/trees/83e79140b3a78c4c6d18560c1881d7379b299235"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sha": "e72afbb4b4412a48374c943c057794a0d74ae87c",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/ltjed/freephdlabor/commit/e72afbb4b4412a48374c943c057794a0d74ae87c",
      "commit": {
        "date": "2026-05-14T18:00:28Z",
        "message": "Add Gemini 3.x preview models, retire Gemini 2.0 / 1.5\n\nPer LiteLLM model registry, gemini-2.0-flash-001 and\ngemini-2.0-flash-lite-001 deprecate June 1 2026; gemini-1.5-* are\nalready retired. Drop them from supported lists and from\nOpenDeepSearch defaults; replace with gemini-2.5-flash[-lite].\n\nAdd Gemini 3 preview lineup (gemini-3.1-pro-preview,\ngemini-3.1-flash-lite-preview, gemini-3-flash-preview) and stable\ngemini-2.5-* to AVAILABLE_MODELS / MODEL_CONTEXT_LIMITS. Extend\nthinking_budget to all gemini-3.x and gemini-2.5-pro models in\ncreate_model.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "b4cffe4b7338fadf9183aa78415926f7acb018f5",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ltjed/freephdlabor/git/trees/b4cffe4b7338fadf9183aa78415926f7acb018f5"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sha": "92c77da3704477a30b03e859a4026f369ec552dc",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/ltjed/freephdlabor/commit/92c77da3704477a30b03e859a4026f369ec552dc",
      "commit": {
        "date": "2026-05-14T17:57:40Z",
        "message": "Migrate OpenAI defaults to GPT-5.5 (released April 2026)\n\nGPT-5.5 is the current OpenAI flagship per LiteLLM's model registry\n(1M context, released 2026-04-23). Update defaults across all entry\npoints and config files; expand AVAILABLE_MODELS / AVAILABLE_LLMS to\ncover the gpt-5.x family (5.1, 5.2, 5.3, 5.4 mini/nano, 5.5, 5.5-pro).\n\nReplace hardcoded gpt-4o-2024-05-13 / o1-2024-12-17 / o3-mini-2025-01-31\ndefaults in launch_scientist_bfts.py, perform_writeup.py,\nperform_icbinb_writeup.py, perform_plotting.py, perform_ideation_temp_free.py,\nbfts_config.yaml, run_experiment_tool.py, vlm_document_analysis_tool.py,\nvisual_qa.py, and the .claude/commands/*.md examples.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
        "tree": {
          "sha": "ea8f62a520f58ce7fa37dc0c886065e22d63c765",
          "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/ltjed/freephdlabor/git/trees/ea8f62a520f58ce7fa37dc0c886065e22d63c765"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "sha": "799e7e8c193476f3696decb771660f83af0d905f",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/ltjed/freephdlabor/commit/799e7e8c193476f3696decb771660f83af0d905f",
      "commit": {
        "date": "2026-05-14T17:49:16Z",
        "message": "Migrate Anthropic model IDs to Claude 4.6/4.7 generation\n\nRetired Claude 3.x and pre-4.5 IDs (3-5-sonnet-*, 3-7-sonnet-*,\n3-haiku-*, 3-opus-*, 4-20250514) have been removed from the API\nsince Oct 2025–Apr 2026. Replace with current generation:\nclaude-opus-4-7 (flagship, 1M ctx), claude-sonnet-4-6, and\nclaude-haiku-4-5. Default model in .llm_config.yaml is now\nclaude-opus-4-7.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
